Listed a group's members on its page ten at a time, with Volto's own pagination, instead of showing only a search box. The search narrows the list, and the search and the page are kept in the URL. Somebody who may change the members gets a **Manage members** button, which opens a page at `<group>/manage-members` to add several people and groups at once and to remove members. Every change goes through `plone.restapi`'s existing endpoints. @ericof
